&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;Everpure (NYSE: P) has evolved from storage pioneer to data platform, closing fiscal 2026 with $3.7 billion in revenue, its first billion-dollar quarter, and accelerating growth into FY27. Our strategic agenda spans the companies defining the next era of technology - hyperscalers, AI labs, the AI hardware supply chain, data platform providers, and the broader AI ecosystem.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;This type of work—work that changes the world—is what the tech industry was founded on. So, if you&#39;re ready to seize the endless opportunities and leave your mark, come join us.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;hr&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Are you a driven sales expert with a passion for the telecom industry? Do you thrive in high-growth environments, closing complex global deals and building strategic partnerships? If so, we want to hear from you!&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Why Everpure?&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Everpure, formerly Pure Storage, has evolved from redefining storage to rethinking data management. Our Enterprise Data Cloud unifies and governs data across on-premises, hybrid, and public cloud environments as a single intelligent system, with policy-driven control through Everpure Fusion. With the addition of 1touch, we discover, classify, and contextualize data wherever it lives, so our customers’ data is secure, sovereign, compliant, and AI-ready at the source.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;For telecom operators, that means fewer silos, predictable economics through Evergreen//One consumption pricing, non-disruptive upgrades under our Evergreen architecture, and Portworx for Kubernetes and containerized network functions. Less cost, less risk, faster outcomes.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
